WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:14.522
Kip was standing on his head.

2
00:00:14.523 --> 00:00:17.139
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

3
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.824
"You're very silly, Kip."

4
00:00:19.825 --> 00:00:23.682
"And I'm standing on my head," said Kip.

5
00:00:23.683 --> 00:00:26.560
"Soon I'll be very good at it."

6
00:00:26.561 --> 00:00:32.222
"You're doing great," said Bird.

7
00:00:32.223 --> 00:00:35.861
"You're very good at standing on your head."

8
00:00:35.862 --> 00:00:39.993
"I think I'll do this all day long," said Kip.

9
00:00:39.994 --> 00:00:45.416
Just then a ladybug flew by.

10
00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:52.177
It flew all around.

11
00:00:52.178 --> 00:00:55.412
Then it landed on Kip's foot.

12
00:00:55.413 --> 00:01:00.994
It walked across his toes.

13
00:01:00.995 --> 00:01:03.765
"Hey!" Kip laughed.

14
00:01:03.766 --> 00:01:20.158
"Ha-ha! That tickles!"

15
00:01:20.159 --> 00:01:24.720
Kip started to lose his balance.

16
00:01:24.721 --> 00:01:34.092
"Uh-oh!" he said. "I'm going to fall!"

17
00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:38.962
Boom!

18
00:01:38.963 --> 00:01:44.180
"Kip, are you okay?" asked Bird.

19
00:01:44.181 --> 00:01:47.397
"I'm not hurt," said Kip.

20
00:01:47.398 --> 00:01:51.020
"But I'm not happy anymore."

21
00:01:51.021 --> 00:01:53.942
"Why not?" asked Bird.

22
00:01:53.943 --> 00:01:59.848
"Because I fell down," said Kip.

23
00:01:59.849 --> 00:02:09.263
"I didn't stand on my head all day long.

24
00:02:09.264 --> 00:02:13.144
So I'm not very good at it!"
